OL,3,GNEWSAEducation reform under way as
OL,4,AScotland sees 'poorest' Pisa results
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe education secretary says she will
OL,7,Foversee the "largest reform" to
OL,8,FScotland's curriculum after a school
OL,9,Fsurvey showed a slight decline in
OL,10,Freading and maths.
OL,12,FThe 2025 Programme for International
OL,13,FStudent Assessment (Pisa) saw pupils in
OL,14,FScotland and Wales fall behind England
OL,15,Fin reading, maths and science tests.
OL,17,FThe international study, which is
OL,18,Fpublished every three years, records
OL,19,Fthe knowledge and skills of more than
OL,20,F760,000 15-year-olds from 91 countries.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
