OL,3,GNEWSAEducation reform under way as
OL,4,AScotland sees 'poorest' Pisa results
OL,5,
OL,6,FMC iri McAllan said she is "clear-eyed"
OL,7,Fabout the results, but while they
OL,8,F"indicate success in our education
OL,9,Fsystem" they also "indicate change is
OL,10,Frequired".
